S(8,10,r'Which of the following are the correct values for A in LSTDQ method.'+'\n'+r'Note the samples are $D=\{s_i,a_i,s_i^\prime,r_i\}$, $\phi(s_i,a_i)$ is the representation used for $(s_i,a_i)$ pair and $\pi$ is the policy being followed',r'$\frac1L\sum_{i=1}^L[\phi(s_i,a_i)(\phi(s_i,a_i)-\gamma\phi(s_i^\prime,a_i))^T]$||$\frac1L\sum_{i=1}^L[\phi(s_i)(\phi(s_i)-\gamma\phi(s_i^\prime))^T]$||$\frac1L\sum_{i=1}^L[\phi(s_i,a_i)(\phi(s_i,a_i)-\gamma\phi(s_i^\prime))^T]$||$\frac1L\sum_{i=1}^L[\phi(s_i,a_i)(\phi(s_i,a_i)-\gamma\phi(s_i^\prime,\pi(s_i^\prime)))^T]$')
